flowchart TD
  Docs[documents in folder] --> Profile[detect_intake_profile<br/>intake_mode.py]

  Profile --> Strategy{primary_strategy}

  Strategy -->|portfolio| PortPath[Portfolio path]
  Strategy -->|interpretation| PDFPath[PDF-first path]
  Strategy -->|mixed| MixedPath[Mixed path]

  subgraph portfolio [Portfolio path — structured folders]
    P1[01-Business-Requirements BRD]
    P2[02-Product-Requirements PRD]
    P3[04-Use-Cases UC]
    P4[05-Acceptance-Criteria AC]
    P5[combined PDF optional<br/>regex_split via combined.py]
    P1 --> PReady[ReadinessAgent<br/>file type check]
    P2 --> PReady
    P3 --> PReady
    P4 --> PReady
    P5 --> PReady
  end

  subgraph pdffirst [PDF-first path — TestLink / INC]
    PDF[Single PDF PRIMARY_SPEC<br/>Caso de Prueba EMPRESARIAL-xx]
    XLSX[ASSET_BUNDLE xlsx<br/>Usuarios Data Destinos]
    Chunk[qa_spec_chunker<br/>32+ test cases]
    Virt[IntakeInterpretationAgent<br/>synthetic BRD PRD UC AC]
    Obl[ClientIntakeInterpreter<br/>obligations + tiers]
    PDF --> Chunk
    PDF --> Virt
    Chunk --> Obl
    XLSX --> Assets[TestAssetResolver<br/>login_user secrets]
    Obl --> CReady[ReadinessAgent<br/>obligations + target_url]
    Assets --> CReady
  end

  subgraph mixed [Mixed path]
    M1[Some typed docs + unstructured PDF]
    M2[AI interpretation fills gaps]
    M3[Content interpretation if QA spec detected]
    M1 --> M2 --> M3
  end

  PortPath --> portfolio
  PDFPath --> pdffirst
  MixedPath --> mixed

  PReady --> Plan[Phase 1 planning]
  CReady --> Plan
  M3 --> Plan
